    "atom::be22e5b25492a3fed5d88a29": {
      "atom_id": "atom::be22e5b25492a3fed5d88a29",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "探究肠道微生物群如何影响癌症治疗的结局，特别是益生菌能否作为安全有效的辅助手段来减轻抗癌治疗（化疗、放疗、免疫治疗）的胃肠道副作用，并增强免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c85aa5b15fbce748d0b77ff6f4e4dfd991461a0d866053c084809e367ddaab9e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e8acf565078abc3a85bacad5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e8acf565078abc3a85bacad5",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "人类肠道微生物群（gut microbiota）与癌症及其治疗的关系，重点聚焦于益生菌作为抗癌治疗辅助手段的临床应用及机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bf1e148a72122527820c417c1e591bef243b35ba884f9bec2d5901c1d3a0eb50",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b6c9e01d144ad53cb1611b26": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b6c9e01d144ad53cb1611b26",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇2019年发表的综述文章，旨在总结肠道微生物群在癌症发生发展中的作用，以及益生菌作为辅助疗法在减轻抗癌治疗副作用和改善免疫检查点抑制剂疗效方面的最新临床进展。文章首先阐述了肠道菌群失调与癌症风险及治疗毒性的关联，随后回顾了多项临床试验，证明特定益生菌（如乳酸杆菌和双歧杆菌）能有效缓解化疗、放疗引起的腹泻和黏膜炎。特别地，文章详细讨论了模型菌株鼠李糖乳杆菌GG（LGG）的保护机制，并列举了大量正在进行的临床试验以评估其安全性和有效性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b67f045db31ec5d09604649982e515f9d22acaabc1f0772e81774233e8e1ac84",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8336511f650c6d83ff5ab01d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8336511f650c6d83ff5ab01d",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述“肠道微生物群如何调节免疫检查点抑制剂在实体瘤中的疗效”提供了关键的背景框架和具体机制线索。它不仅确认了肠道菌群对ICI疗效的重要性，还区分了两种不同的作用路径：一是通过特定共生菌（如Akkermansia）直接增强免疫反应（针对ICI疗效），二是通过益生菌（如LGG）缓解治疗毒性以维持患者耐受性。这有助于在综述中区分“疗效增强机制”与“副作用管理策略”。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a83484ebc80afb7ebc46075d9be70c29ae33c942f64cfd4a5423114cce4c8d1d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b14e80f9a7f421e778a5ee90": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b14e80f9a7f421e778a5ee90",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些发现主要基于黑色素瘤患者的观察性研究和动物FMT实验，尚未在广泛的其他实体瘤中普遍验证；且未说明这些菌群是原因还是结果。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道菌群组成与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效关联的临床证据。指出黑色素瘤ICI响应者肠道中富集Akkermansia, Alistipes, Clostridiales等菌属，而非响应者则不同。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fbc0bf4c8414d4e48a3a6a9139cfe751f682822c71997c751c68ee4c7bd6f6c4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1fe5c72643fe610db6f1e322": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1fe5c72643fe610db6f1e322",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效”的问题，提供菌群特征与疗效正相关的具体实例。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b3db44eceee25a56b2b79e5cdfed6fc334691fa7dc2081bb9c2f2c2c659e9dd5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2d4cbfba6e3c600e35d0bafc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2d4cbfba6e3c600e35d0bafc",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制细节主要来自小鼠模型（FMT实验），人体内的确切分子通路尚不完全清楚；不同研究识别出的关键菌种存在差异（如有的强调Akkermansia，有的强调Bifidobacterium），提示情境依赖性。",
        "contribution": "揭示了特定细菌介导ICI疗效增强的潜在机制线索。例如，Akkermansia muciniphila可增加肿瘤内细胞毒性T细胞浸润；Bifidobacterium longum等也被认为能改善PD-L1疗效。同时提出了抗生素使用破坏菌群导致ICI疗效下降的反面证据。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fbc0bf4c8414d4e48a3a6a9139cfe751f682822c71997c751c68ee4c7bd6f6c4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fa4119d2e383cd0842bb33b3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fa4119d2e383cd0842bb33b3",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释“介导效应的机制”，即菌群通过调节肿瘤微环境中的免疫细胞浸润（如T细胞）来影响ICI疗效。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b3db44eceee25a56b2b79e5cdfed6fc334691fa7dc2081bb9c2f2c2c659e9dd5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b520a3be90c3e52e0e98c71a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b520a3be90c3e52e0e98c71a",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这是间接效应，不直接回答菌群如何生物化学地调节ICI靶点或免疫通路。",
        "contribution": "提供了益生菌（非特定共生菌，而是补充剂）可能间接影响治疗结局的背景。虽然主要关注副作用缓解，但指出维持健康的肠道平衡可能防止因严重副作用导致的停药，从而间接保证ICI疗程的完成。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fbc0bf4c8414d4e48a3a6a9139cfe751f682822c71997c751c68ee4c7bd6f6c4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6b97d81f963dbb364ca36a40": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6b97d81f963dbb364ca36a40",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "作为对比视角，说明除了直接增强免疫反应外，通过支持性护理（supportive care）维持治疗依从性也是微生物群干预的重要价值。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b3db44eceee25a56b2b79e5cdfed6fc334691fa7dc2081bb9c2f2c2c659e9dd5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fee4e8bf5f4ec766e01a8391": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fee4e8bf5f4ec766e01a8391",
      "source_handle": "P0040",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "将益生菌的作用分为两类：1) 缓解胃肠道毒性（腹泻、黏膜炎）以提高生活质量/依从性；2) 作为免疫调节剂增强ICI疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5daecf072589838cd65e7ed44461f4dd36d5babb2",
          "field_path": [
