    },
    "atom::6324c354c13d7e2ed705c1c9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6324c354c13d7e2ed705c1c9",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "作为一篇综述，本文通过系统梳理免疫学、分子病理学和放射组学的多学科证据，构建了一个整合性的“骨骼肌-肌动蛋白-肠道损伤-修复”调控网络。具体路线包括：1. 描述直肠癌TME的组成及其在免疫治疗下的动态重塑；2. 详细分析ICI诱导肠道损伤的核心机制（T细胞毒性、炎症风暴、菌群失调、血管/代谢紊乱、基质纤维化）；3. 引入骨骼肌作为非肿瘤因素，解析关键肌动蛋白（IL-6, IL-15, Irisin）的信号通路及其双向调节作用；4. 总结多模态影像技术在量化监测黏膜、血管和纤维化病变中的应用；5. 提出基于肌动蛋白稳态恢复的分层修复与管理方案。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e860b5fbd85c27e8614f34278a812283387fcc605aac05026250fc2f1e6d07a0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2d5162d6cd233004604796a7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2d5162d6cd233004604796a7",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "构建了以肌动蛋白为核心的“骨骼肌-肠道”交互调控网络，将全身性肌肉状态与局部肠道免疫毒性联系起来，超越了以往仅关注局部肠道损伤的视角。",
        "limits": "主要基于现有文献的理论综合和机制推演，缺乏大规模前瞻性临床队列数据验证肌动蛋白作为预测生物标志物的特异性截断值和多中心标准化协议。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3754d92b382ece3cef0e837be3755375f50a166e5cc9308dafdb063ea5e81a03",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b2d7496150d88e8dc1579990": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b2d7496150d88e8dc1579990",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了从分子机制到多模态影像表型再到分层干预策略的完整转化链条，为临床精准干预提供了系统性框架。",
        "limits": "许多提出的干预策略（如肌动蛋白靶向药物、特定运动营养方案）仍处于临床前研究或早期临床试验阶段，尚未成为标准护理流程。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3754d92b382ece3cef0e837be3755375f50a166e5cc9308dafdb063ea5e81a03",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ae370a00b74f470391e6b856": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ae370a00b74f470391e6b856",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在dMMR/MSI-H直肠癌TME中",
        "finding": "ICI通过阻断PD-1/PD-L1和CTLA-4通路解除免疫抑制，但过度激活的CD8+ T细胞会错误识别肠上皮细胞抗原，导致黏膜溃疡和穿孔。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6ea94f0e569a34dee92be186e265554f0be1cce45d1a9d38a6013275f29d83c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::dc967120324ff4312b8260e3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dc967120324ff4312b8260e3",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "骨骼肌健康状态良好时",
        "finding": "分泌保护性肌动蛋白IL-15和Irisin，分别通过JAK/STAT5和CSF-1/STAT3通路增强抗肿瘤免疫并抑制M2型巨噬细胞极化，从而保护肠黏膜屏障。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6ea94f0e569a34dee92be186e265554f0be1cce45d1a9d38a6013275f29d83c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::68f1f7fb0220bd4f57d34afe": {
      "atom_id": "atom::68f1f7fb0220bd4f57d34afe",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "存在肌肉萎缩（Sarcopenia）时",
        "finding": "病理性高浓度IL-6持续激活NF-κB和JAK/STAT3通路，引发炎症风暴并促进成纤维细胞活化，加剧肠道炎症和纤维化，形成“肌肉萎缩-肠道损伤”恶性循环。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6ea94f0e569a34dee92be186e265554f0be1cce45d1a9d38a6013275f29d83c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::796aaea2ba6098e425ca1a27": {
      "atom_id": "atom::796aaea2ba6098e425ca1a27",
      "source_handle": "P0217",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "应用多模态影像技术时",
        "finding": "NBI可早期发现黏膜糜烂和隐窝破坏；EUS-SWE可定量评估组织弹性以区分炎症水肿与不可逆纤维化；PET-CT可通过SUV值量化免疫细胞浸润和代谢活性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51f89be549975819db34d833a902728b2f5ee0cf8443c6b08bf2477413b64280",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
