      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6ae95496008086a4260f12cd459e36c9fbae26c867d4de207e7512fa04ef3aef",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e5b4ce3810bfd1ebf3668070": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e5b4ce3810bfd1ebf3668070",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管CIT是实体瘤治疗的常规手段，但存在显著的耐药性和进展问题，且缺乏可靠的预测性生物标志物。本研究旨在理解肿瘤-药物-免疫系统相互作用中的动态事件，特别是通过代谢组学视角，探索如何利用微生物衍生的代谢物来增强免疫反应、克服耐药性，并识别潜在的预测性生物标志物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::71c91dfae355f362e42ccf33b82eb44300c6b70122e1cb7a6f5be569bea57c8d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b644c59cb5947b8ca365930c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b644c59cb5947b8ca365930c",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "免疫检查点抑制剂（CIT）治疗下的实体瘤患者；聚焦于肠道微生物群及其代谢产物（特别是短链脂肪酸SCFA和色氨酸代谢物）对免疫系统及肿瘤微环境（TME）的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7ad4b8c9a40971b3c89d32a315dc37dbb8766eea65e3a06e4bdd1f6a68d5110b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d3110b273e34a9383ac3de88": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d3110b273e34a9383ac3de88",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇2025年发表的综述文章，旨在探讨免疫代谢在优化CIT疗效中的作用。文章首先指出CIT面临耐药性和生物标志物缺乏的挑战，随后系统回顾了肠道微生物衍生的代谢物如何调节免疫反应。重点讨论了短链脂肪酸（SCFA）通过表观遗传和代谢重编程增强CD8+ T细胞功能及记忆形成，以及色氨酸分解代谢（IDO1/Kynurenine通路）作为原发性CIT失败预测因子的角色。此外，文章还分析了葡萄糖、氨基酸和脂质等其他代谢特征与CIT预后的关联，并评估了直接补充代谢物或靶向递送策略的潜力，同时指出了当前临床转化的局限性和未来方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::61e1c09c5ea08fb25b38e894925f6b25d2d0f9d5c9caca73af8c55e85142bd50",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d0d09ef299b5f485e56208e8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d0d09ef299b5f485e56208e8",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂疗效”这一核心问题提供了详细的机制解释和临床关联素材。它特别适用于回答关于微生物代谢物具体作用机制（F2）的问题，包括SCFA对T细胞功能的正向调节、色氨酸代谢导致的免疫抑制，以及这些代谢变化如何作为预测性生物标志物。此外，它还提供了关于益生菌干预复杂性的反面案例，有助于全面评估微生物调控策略的风险与收益。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d851bf86067842075bd949302e335232fb90e40be36fc03684c0bdd88187b6ab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7153f06a14631bf9868707e4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7153f06a14631bf9868707e4",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "样本量较小（如Botticelli et al. n=11, Nomura et al. n=52），且不同研究间代谢物测量部位（粪便vs血浆）和癌症类型不同，结果可能存在异质性。不能直接推断因果关系，仅为观察性关联。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物代谢物影响CIT疗效的具体临床关联证据。例如，粪便SCFA水平与NSCLC患者PFS的正相关性，以及色氨酸代谢异常与黑色素瘤/肾癌患者OS的负相关性。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17824d2cbe412180499b976d6ca17b089f868fede0359a9fc80b5dba63fa9836",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::665fa04f922701179715b38f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::665fa04f922701179715b38f",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证微生物代谢物作为CIT疗效预测生物标志物的潜力，支持“微生物群状态决定治疗响应”的观点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7f5494a5eed201a4e83129846e65045b76f7d11d97e2bcd18462e9579c213687",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::45f344091216d4c71eef5c6a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::45f344091216d4c71eef5c6a",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "许多机制细节源自小鼠模型（如germ-free mice, adoptive transfer），需注明物种差异限制。作者提到的“代谢重编程”多为假设性解释，需结合其他实验验证。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物代谢物调节免疫细胞的分子机制。包括：1) SCFA通过抑制HDAC和激活GPCRs（如GPR43, GPR41）促进CD8+ T细胞效应功能和记忆形成；2) 色氨酸分解通过IDO1途径产生犬尿氨酸，抑制T细胞增殖并诱导Treg分化；3) 代谢重编程（如糖酵解增强）对T细胞功能的重要性。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17824d2cbe412180499b976d6ca17b089f868fede0359a9fc80b5dba63fa9836",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5dcf4fbf7723315b9a3be52e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5dcf4fbf7723315b9a3be52e",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释微生物群影响CIT疗效的具体生物学路径，区分不同的代谢通路（脂肪酸 vs 氨基酸 vs 脂质）对免疫细胞的不同影响。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7f5494a5eed201a4e83129846e65045b76f7d11d97e2bcd18462e9579c213687",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9a856efced7c50c546f85e0c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9a856efced7c50c546f85e0c",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要依据是小鼠预临床数据，人类数据有限且多为自我报告或小型观察性研究。不能据此推荐或反对通用的益生菌使用。",
        "contribution": "提供了关于益生菌干预效果的矛盾证据。指出某些商业益生菌在小鼠模型中损害抗肿瘤免疫，而特定菌株（L. reuteri）可能有益，强调了菌株特异性和情境依赖性。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17824d2cbe412180499b976d6ca17b089f868fede0359a9fc80b5dba63fa9836",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f585fd4dc0b8a4d707b89b4b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f585fd4dc0b8a4d707b89b4b",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于说明并非所有微生物干预都是有益的，强调精准微生物调控的重要性，反驳“益生菌普遍有益”的简单化观点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7f5494a5eed201a4e83129846e65045b76f7d11d97e2bcd18462e9579c213687",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6dbc35e5cf5535a7ebc5da63": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6dbc35e5cf5535a7ebc5da63",
      "source_handle": "P0472",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "综述提到血清代谢组学（LC-MS, GC-MS）可捕捉全身代谢改变，而单细胞/空间代谢组学可解析TME内的异质性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca0cd8cf75bc9b1aa650c230b683b301f22d44519b8b9e055b3ce5b2a5e50c3e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
