    },
    "atom::f26edbe5015e9f0921d1d9cb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f26edbe5015e9f0921d1d9cb",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物影响癌症治疗反应，但其介导免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）毒性的具体机制尚不清楚，且如何平衡疗效与毒性仍是一个关键挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d9daa7ed3d6e61c2cc36a2245b68e8332646f875f5619704986384f3f3b1aa27",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fbd72622ace5bb68d2208e8a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fbd72622ace5bb68d2208e8a",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "癌症免疫治疗中的肠道微生物群，特别是针对免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）的毒性机制；涉及临床前模型（小鼠）与人类临床观察的联系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2540f2a4be403b3d9a33c2946889f7f3fbd71e9638fbc631f405924c0a3e07d1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::432c07c02c59977b879fe092": {
      "atom_id": "atom::432c07c02c59977b879fe092",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇评论性文章（Perspective），主要评述了Blake等人近期在《Cell Reports Medicine》发表的研究成果。该研究通过临床前模型发现，肠道微生物群通过MyD88依赖性途径激活宿主免疫系统，导致在使用抗CD40和抗CD137等免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）治疗时引发严重的系统性炎症和肝毒性。作者指出，虽然抗生素清除菌群可减轻毒性，但也会损害其他免疫疗法的效果，因此强调需要更精细地靶向微生物-宿主互作的具体分子机制，而非简单使用广谱抗生素。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0969253674c8c874d972c1ede9517212dace9bc7f1178436acc594df924634f0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1d059bd295ed1fd1f2e6e1e3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1d059bd295ed1fd1f2e6e1e3",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该文献为理解肠道微生物群如何导致免疫治疗（特别是免疫激动剂抗体）的非预期毒性提供了关键的机制视角。它补充了当前综述中关于微生物不仅影响疗效（响应率），还直接影响安全性（毒性）的证据链，并指出了MyD88信号通路在这一过程中的核心作用。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ce0851cd4cae5160b4f05959140c787dc35c7838a58287b6cb6a8b3d9181256f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::91578d82f6254e6e4980051e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::91578d82f6254e6e4980051e",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要针对免疫激动剂抗体（IAA）的毒性机制，而非直接解释免疫检查点抑制剂（ICB）的疗效增强机制；机制细节基于临床前小鼠模型，需警惕外推到人体的复杂性。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了肠道微生物通过MyD88通路介导IAA毒性的具体机制：在抗CD40治疗中，微生物激活巨噬细胞产生TNFα/IL-6/IFN-I导致肝损伤；在抗CD137治疗中，激活导致CD8+ T细胞依赖的IFNγ炎症。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::eb4f632d49745d883ed5b24546fb1780ba620e00d8f34ce5efbed8515ae9990a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6bf3e7b9c8402f9dc3a43f59": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6bf3e7b9c8402f9dc3a43f59",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“哪些机制介导了微生物对免疫治疗的影响”，特别是解释毒性发生的生物学路径，而不仅仅是相关性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a6bcf06819eb4a56c9146c06049be24ae9cca9e0de6380859ce0f6321909b17f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::60c245848565553f2f3e83d1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::60c245848565553f2f3e83d1",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要关联毒性而非直接提升疗效的机制；未提供具体的预测性菌株列表。",
        "contribution": "指出肠道微生物多样性与特定菌群组成是预测免疫治疗反应和毒性的潜在生物标志物；提示微生物群落作为一个整体（consortium）发挥作用，而非单一物种。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::eb4f632d49745d883ed5b24546fb1780ba620e00d8f34ce5efbed8515ae9990a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3ed6bbcde13f328ad44f42ce": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3ed6bbcde13f328ad44f42ce",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "支持综述中关于微生物作为生物标志物的论述，并为解释为何某些患者出现严重不良反应提供背景。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d77a8c0088cfe726193fbc3d84c3f36ee4e72626d48da0759330942407601237",
          "field_path": [
