      "atom_id": "atom::db1a8526b39521aa11a97825",
      "source_handle": "P0126",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "对比ICB与IAA中微生物作用的不同：ICB中微生物主要促进抗肿瘤免疫（STING-IFN-I通路），而IAA中微生物主要驱动过度炎症毒性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
