      ],
      "value": "背景信息：ICI治疗的严重副作用及其潜在机制",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::458437782a562f994cbafc812c61da07c559fa9cf0d4ede375d00d4231da3938",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0",
            "purpose"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7faa83caca7e396af085b3865107ef2b21fafe5b08f4cef7254b12e20dd6bbd0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a17f82f767433f2f8669c5e9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a17f82f767433f2f8669c5e9",
      "source_handle": "P0149",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "心肌损伤可由TNF介导的炎症驱动，而非仅由细胞毒性T细胞的直接杀伤引起。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::458437782a562f994cbafc812c61da07c559fa9cf0d4ede375d00d4231da3938",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::45e51ae24ef4c78f1b23c2d76baf14d6473b71ac1ccfccf68ef8ac71614ff9a8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f5397896a0bc6c0c010ac714": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f5397896a0bc6c0c010ac714",
      "source_handle": "P0149",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "这提示ICI的不良反应机制可能是多层次的。如果肠道菌群被证明能调节ICI疗效，其作用机制可能不仅限于增强抗肿瘤T细胞反应，还可能涉及调节全身炎症水平或特定细胞因子（如TNF）的表达，从而间接影响心脏等器官的安全性。该论文提供了一个具体的炎症介质（TNF）作为潜在的调控靶点，可供后续思考菌群-TNF轴的联系。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::458437782a562f994cbafc812c61da07c559fa9cf0d4ede375d00d4231da3938",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "1",
            "connection_to_review"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b701af62fa85d725fc6468bbd7b6001f321aced384ff33a49de65cc3ffa8d77d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::57476d94c0a3eac045560179": {
      "atom_id": "atom::57476d94c0a3eac045560179",
      "source_handle": "P0149",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "purpose"
      ],
      "value": "对比/反例：机制的多样性",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::458437782a562f994cbafc812c61da07c559fa9cf0d4ede375d00d4231da3938",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
