    "atom::ac74c74d6e2438f8ebc2a108": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ac74c74d6e2438f8ebc2a108",
      "source_handle": "P0027",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该论文是文献计量学和综述性质的文章，其提供的“发现”多为对已有研究的统计归纳和趋势判断，而非新的原始实验证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::fa942646656c220debc219bb0d0ab46789c6676bed1b259b4dc41e8340fd710d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::912bcc959c4654bc9f2575365b4fae9b693440325ca605c087e9eb1e2373f564",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a28df6909bfda1c329c39738": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a28df6909bfda1c329c39738",
      "source_handle": "P0027",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "关于肠道微生物群在肿瘤中定植的结论，主要基于对现有文献中共同检出菌群的观察，尚未建立完整的因果链条或定植机制的确证，需谨慎解读其普遍性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::fa942646656c220debc219bb0d0ab46789c6676bed1b259b4dc41e8340fd710d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::912bcc959c4654bc9f2575365b4fae9b693440325ca605c087e9eb1e2373f564",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c6008a7b86950a2db51f2876": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c6008a7b86950a2db51f2876",
      "source_handle": "P0027",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "干预研究的效果总结（如“大多数为负面”）是基于纳入的69项研究的简单计数，未考虑研究设计的异质性、肿瘤亚型差异及统计学效力，不能直接推断所有肿瘤内微生物均有害。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::fa942646656c220debc219bb0d0ab46789c6676bed1b259b4dc41e8340fd710d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::912bcc959c4654bc9f2575365b4fae9b693440325ca605c087e9eb1e2373f564",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::67b5405704b6ad7537c29821": {
      "atom_id": "atom::67b5405704b6ad7537c29821",
      "source_handle": "P0027",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的具体机制（如丁酸、乳酸的作用）是作者对他人研究的综合转述，引用时需追溯原始实验研究以获取确切的分子细节。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::fa942646656c220debc219bb0d0ab46789c6676bed1b259b4dc41e8340fd710d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::912bcc959c4654bc9f2575365b4fae9b693440325ca605c087e9eb1e2373f564",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
