    "atom::01c5d880718ea85b7b6946a3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::01c5d880718ea85b7b6946a3",
      "source_handle": "P0055",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述涵盖多种癌症类型（黑色素瘤、肺癌、肾癌、胰腺癌等）和多种ICI药物，但在具体机制上多为小鼠模型推导，需区分动物实验结论与人类临床证据的强度差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::be68bb0094ea724179acc24003ec835c6c88c7eaba3ff43870323ebac375ca65",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e1f659a9fd01a4d934ce5d0516b962241c2757924752aedc9eaceeb8735c053c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::19a3a17ed39f9ff6414416d1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::19a3a17ed39f9ff6414416d1",
      "source_handle": "P0055",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的‘共识’是基于多篇独立研究的汇总，而非单一大型随机对照试验的结果，因此具体菌种的预测价值仍存在争议和不一致性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::be68bb0094ea724179acc24003ec835c6c88c7eaba3ff43870323ebac375ca65",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e1f659a9fd01a4d934ce5d0516b962241c2757924752aedc9eaceeb8735c053c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::05c51b859eba2ea39414cad8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::05c51b859eba2ea39414cad8",
      "source_handle": "P0055",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "机制部分包含大量‘假说’和‘潜在’通路，并非所有提及的机制都在人类实体瘤中得到了直接证实，引用时需保持谨慎，避免过度解读因果关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::be68bb0094ea724179acc24003ec835c6c88c7eaba3ff43870323ebac375ca65",
