    "atom::edbbd751ab16d1eae729ec05": {
      "atom_id": "atom::edbbd751ab16d1eae729ec05",
      "source_handle": "P0295",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述包含的是观察性关联，而非因果关系。细菌的存在可能与疗效相关，但不一定导致疗效。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dde30de1dbc801a91e528e0f1c12feeb2411201cc8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::25afb95acfef3c5eec2ae434b41ca88815507b25e9b269b5d2ab3b20e9081827",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ce0f3c36bf1bb726074ca4f9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ce0f3c36bf1bb726074ca4f9",
      "source_handle": "P0295",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "结果受到原始研究中“响应者”定义不一致的影响（部分研究将稳定疾病SD视为响应，部分视为无响应），这可能导致某些细菌的分类模糊。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dde30de1dbc801a91e528e0f1c12feeb2411201cc8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::25afb95acfef3c5eec2ae434b41ca88815507b25e9b269b5d2ab3b20e9081827",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c2e2a294c7c188e4f32b612e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c2e2a294c7c188e4f32b612e",
      "source_handle": "P0295",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同癌症类型的微生物背景不同，不能简单地将一种癌症中发现的细菌标志物推广到其他癌症，除非有跨癌症的一致证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dde30de1dbc801a91e528e0f1c12feeb2411201cc8",
          "field_path": [
